<title>USA: Asahi/America Inc names Leslie chairman.</title>
<headline>Asahi/America Inc names Leslie chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MALDEN, Mass. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi/America, Inc said on Monday said that Leslie B. Lewis, president and chief executive since 1989, has been appointed to the newly created post of chairman.</p>
<p>Asahi is a marketer and manufacturer of thermoplastic valves, piping systems and components.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
